From 578c020f01728b515ad718cdab8351a02a150715 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TNlucfer01 <ihdaa2006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:31:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign the admin dashboard on a design system

Design system
- Colour tokens for light and dark themes (navy frame, brand blue,
  semantic and task status colours, chart and timesheet scales)
- IBM Plex Sans with one type scale; tables and KPI strips as panels
- Dark mode follows the operating system

Overview
- New GET /api/admin/dashboard/summary computes the whole overview
- KPI strip: active people, not started, pending, completed, overdue
- Needs attention: waiting for review, overdue, due this week
- On the clock with live timers; refreshes every 60 seconds
- Projects with progress split by department
- Departments: people, working now, open, overdue, done, hours,
  time on tasks, rating
- Team hours for 14 days by department, and recent activity
- Ranking moved to the People page

Also
- Department picker in the user form says why it couldn't load
- Task status "To do" is now "Not started"; #/tasks/status/<status> links
